cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this architecture proposal and reference implementation."
title: "AA-ZTCE: An Assurance-Driven Security Architecture for Autonomous Multi-Agent Systems"
authors:
  - family-names: "Yousef"
    given-names: "Abid"
version: "0.2.0"
date-released: "2026-10-15"
url: "https://github.com/Abidqwer/AA-ZTCE"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Proposed architecture and local reference implementation combining per-agent
  identity, environment and workflow evidence, scoped cryptographic sessions,
  hierarchical approval, continuous checkpoints and revocation. Preliminary
  self-authored tests and Z3 model checks are included with explicit limitations.
